.md) — .*|- [First-run boards](first-run-flow-boards.md) — canvas v89: first-run-welcome-01..03 + 04..11 (11 = flow board); wizard boards superseded; five states still undrawn.|' MEMORY.md && grep 'First-run boards' MEMORY.md","description":"Record the new boards and the remaining gaps in the boards memory"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JhPGPgTFBpKydSaawvoRwU","name":"SendUserFile","input":{"files":["/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/design-captures/first-run-2026-11/11-flow.png","/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/design-captures/first-run-2026-11/07-orcaslicer-import.png","/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/design-captures/first-run-2026-11/04-welcome-sign-in-waiting.png","/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/design-captures/first-run-2026-11/10-home-after-just-slice.png"],"caption":"The flow board, the OrcaSlicer import step, the welcome while sign-in waits, and Home after \"Just slice for now\".","status":"proactive","display":"render"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
