t click](webkit-click-does-not-focus-buttons.md) — no focus on click; blur menus lose clicks.\n- [All settings panel](all-settings-panel.md) — four decisions, settings_catalog, selection trap.\n- [ModelVolume copy](modelvolume-copy-keeps-object-id.md) — keeps ObjectID, breaks undo; use a new mesh.\n- [Add-printer form](add-printer-popup-feasibility.md) — merged f073fdba96; decisions, tests, Haiku runs.\n- [Turn activity](agent-turn-activity-proposal.md) — one TurnActivity line per turn, not 17 cards.\n- [Catalogue cost](printer-catalog-load-cost.md) — ~0.95 s per launch; panel opens ~50 ms.\n- [Calibration design](calibration-design-decisions.md) — own project, temp/flow/PA first.\n- [Artifact watch](artifact-watch-crosstalk.md) — publish arms auto-replies; stop it with two sessions.\n- [Saved API key](api-key-saved-state.md) — saved_keys, hint rule; \"rejected\" = a chat 401.\n- [Live host check](live-host-check-via-instrumented-dev-page.md) — JUSPRIN_AGENT_DEV_URL + injected logger.\n- [Shared Mac builds](pkill-cmake-build-leaves-ninja.md) — one at a time, -j4; pkill orphans ninja.; [Running ninja](check-for-running-ninja-before-nohup-build.md) — pgrep first; kill yours at turn end.; [Ninja bad record](ninja-deps-bad-record-repeat-rebuild.md) — ~780 recompiles; `ninja -t recompact`.\n- [Check print design](check-print-design-decisions.md) — slice_report panel; Legend + Moves toggles.; [Check print built](check-print-implementation.md) — ImGui display-size fix; harness --check-print.\n- [Tool errors](tool-error-contract.md) — one list in Agent/ToolErrors.hpp; busy fails.\n- [Canvas boards](canvas-boards-from-bundle-rules.md) — from bundle.css + app markup, not older boards.\n- [Calibration generators](calibration-generators-replace-project.md) — calib_* swap the project identity.\n- [Setup one flow](agent-setup-one-flow-decisions.md) — Preferences › Agent for every entry point.\n- [cmake edit rebuild](cmake-file-edit-forces-full-rebuild.md) — new file changes GIT_C