w:hidden\"><div data-c=\"Status Dot:State=Not connected\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:relative;width:8px;height:8px\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;position:absolute;left:0px;top:0px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;outline:1px dashed var(--text-secondary);outline-offset:-1px\"></div></div><div class=\"label\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--text-secondary)\">Agent not connected</div></div></div><div data-n=\"Welcome content\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;flex:1 1 0;min-height:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:0px 0px var(--space-32) 0px;justify-content:center;align-items:center;overflow:hidden\"><div data-n=\"Welcome columns\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;width:960px;display:flex;gap:var(--space-48);align-items:center;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;width:440px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-24);align-items:flex-start;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-12);align-items:flex-start;overflow:hidden\"><div class=\"label-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">WELCOME TO JUSPRIN</div><div class=\"page-title\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">Your Orca workflow, with help planning the print.</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">Bring along your existing projects and tuned presets. Describe what matters, review proposed changes, and keep control—with Undo whenever you need it.</div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;gap:var(--space-24);align-items:flex-start;overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-8);align-items:flex-start;overflow:hidden\"><div data-c=\"Button/Primary:State=Default\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;display:flex;gap:6px;padding:var(--space-8) var(--space-16) var(--space-8) var(--space-16);justify-content:center;align-items:center;background:var(--action-primary);border-radius:var(--radius-medium)\"><div class=\"body-small-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--action-on-primary)\">Set up JusPrin</div></div><div class=\"label\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">Start with account setup.<br>Connect an Agent afterward.</div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;flex:1 1 0;min-width:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-8);align-items:flex-start;overflow:hidden\"><div data-c=\"Button/Secondary:State=Default\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;display:flex;gap:6px;padding:6px var(--space-12) 6px var(--space-12);justify-content:center;align-items:center;border-radius:var(--radius-small);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle)\"><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--text-primary)\">Explore first</div></div><div class=\"label\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">Start locally with profiles, printer setup, then a project. Steps you’ve already completed are skipped.</div></div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-4);padding:var(--space-16) 0px 0px 0px;align-items:flex-start;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 0 var(--border-subtle);overflow:hidden\"><div class=\"label-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--action-primary)\">Dismiss onboarding and continue locally</div><div class=\"label\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">Leave this guide and use JusPrin locally. You can open setup later.</div></div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;width:472px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-24);padding:var(--space-24) var(--space-24) var(--space-24) var(--space-24);align-items:flex-start;background:var(--surface-subtle);border-radius:var(--radius-medium);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--border-subtle);overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-8);align-items:flex-start;overflow:hidden\"><div class=\"label-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">EXAMPLE INTERACTION · NOT LIVE</div><div class=\"label\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">Illustrative only. No project has been inspected.</div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-20);padding:var(--space-16) var(--space-16) var(--space-16) var(--space-16);align-items:flex-start;background:var(--surface-raised);border-radius:var(--radius-small);overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-8);padding:0px 0px 0px var(--space-16);align-items:flex-start;box-shadow:inset 2px 0 0 0 var(--border-subtle);overflow:hidden\"><div class=\"label-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">You</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">Keep the front smooth. I don’t mind a longer print.</div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-8);padding:0px 0px 0px var(--space-16);align-items:flex-start;box-shadow:inset 2px 0 0 0 var(--border-subtle);overflow:hidden\"><div class=\"label-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-secondary)\">Agent · example response</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;color:var(--text-primary)\">I’ll compare orientations that keep support contact off the front, then show you the tradeoff.</div></div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--space-12);padding:var(--space-16) 0px 0px 0px;align-items:flex-start;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 0 var(--border-subtle);overflow:hidden\"><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;overflow:hidden\"><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--text-secondary)\">Your intent</div><div class=\"body-small-bold\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--text-primary)\">Better surface finish</div></div><div style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;overflow:hidden\"><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--text-secondary)\">Your control</div><div class=\"body-small\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--text-primary)\">Inspect · Edit · Undo</div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-n=\"Application footer\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;align-self:stretch;height:32px;display:flex;padding:0px var(--space-24) 0px var(--space-24);align-items:center;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 0 var(--border-subtle);overflow:hidden\"><div class=\"label\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;flex:none;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--text-secondary)\">Local setup and projects are available without an Agent. Account setup comes first if you want to connect one.</div></div></div></div>\n</x-dc>\n<script typ