s the user in the app, right? And it's becoming more and more common and users are getting used to it. let's incorporate this into your design.\n\n\nI agree with all the things you said."},"uuid":"7668c9a9-970e-4732-b153-d18267817bcf","timestamp":"2026-11-03T14:39:18.593Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":41,"turnIndex":53},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/JusPrin/.claude/worktrees/first-run-flow-f7be35","sessionId":"e997298c-6edf-4c7d-8994-08bc7e301a34","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"claude/first-run-flow-f7be35","slug":"distributed-snuggling-crane"}
