{"parentUuid":"1b3a231f-8776-42f5-b830-a8c7c6dab4bc","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3b8f975a-379e-4fed-8a28-01d66198f3b3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LfBiL85UTdHcQChdHjX6Zh","type":"tool_result","content":"**Login by code entries**\n\n- **0.62.0 (2024-04-22):** Introduced login by code. The entry reads: \"Added support for logging in by email using a special code, also known as \"Magic Code Login\"\".\n- **64.2.0 (2024-08-30):** Added required login by code. The entry begins: \"Added support for requiring logging in by code...\" and points to `ACCOUNT_LOGIN_BY_CODE_REQUIRED`.\n- **65.2.0 (2024-11-08), Fixes:** A `NoReverseMatch` could occur when `ACCOUNT_LOGIN_BY_CODE_REQUIRED = True` was used while `ACCOUNT_LOGIN_BY_CODE_ENABLED = False`. Fixed.\n- **65.1.0 (2024-10-23), Fixes:** In headless mode, submitting a login code after the login flow expired returned a 500. It now returns a 409.\n\n**Headless API**\n\n- **0.63.0 (2024-05-14):** Introduced the headless API. The entry says an official API for single-page and mobile application support is now available via the new `allauth.headless` app.\n\n**Login by code creating accounts for unknown emails**\n\n- None. No entry says that login by code signs up or creates an account when the email address is unknown.\n\n**Related but not sign-in**\n\n- **64.2.0 (2024-08-30):** Added email verification by code (`ACCOUNT_EMAIL_VERIFICATION_BY_CODE_ENABLED`). This is verification, not sign-in."}]},"uuid":"546b3d14-8fd9-411b-8fa4-c7f648b8ec88","timestamp":"2026-11-03T14:41:47.869Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":99541,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**Login by code entries**\n\n- **0.62.0 (2024-04-22):** Introduced login by code. The entry reads: \"Added support for logging in by email using a special code, also known as \"Magic Code Login\"\".\n- **64.2.0 (2024-08-30):** Added required login by code. The entry begins: \"Added support for requiring logging in by code...\" and points to `ACCOUNT_LOGIN_BY_CODE_REQUIRED`.\n- **65.2.0 (2024-11-08), Fixes:** A `NoReverseMatch` could occur when `ACCOUNT_LOGIN_BY_CODE_REQUIRED = True` was used while `ACCOUNT_LOGIN_BY_CODE_ENABLED = False`. Fixed.\n- **65.1.0 (2024-10-23), Fixes:** In headless mode, submitting a login code after the login flow expired returned a 500. It now returns a 409.\n\n**Headless API**\n\n- **0.63.0 (2024-05-14):** Introduced the headless API. The entry says an official API for single-page and mobile application support is now available via the new `allauth.headless` app.\n\n**Login by code creating accounts for unknown emails**\n\n- None. No entry says that login by code signs up or creates an account when the email address is unknown.\n\n**Related but not sign-in**\n\n- **64.2.0 (2024-08-30):** Added email verification by code (`ACCOUNT_EMAIL_VERIFICATION_BY_CODE_ENABLED`). This is verification, not sign-in.","durationMs":8464,"url":"https://docs.allauth.org/en/dev/release-notes/2024.html"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1b3a231f-8776-42f5-b830-a8c7c6dab4bc","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise","sessionId":"e997298c-6edf-4c7d-8994-08bc7e301a34","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"claude/first-run-flow-f7be35","slug":"distributed-snuggling-crane"}
{"parentUuid":"192558d8-c8e9-4401-b456-c06061c61e97","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3b8f975a-379e-4fed-8a28-01d66198f3b3","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012HQfmwrEofBnrpcFvSfKPb","type":"tool_result","content":"**Entries mentioning \"code\" (no entries mention passkey signup, signup by code, or unknown email):**\n\n- **65.13.0 (2025-10-31):** \"Added support for “Trust this browser?” functionality for logging in by code.\" Setting: `ACCOUNT_LOGIN_BY_CODE_TRUST_ENABLED`.\n- **65.10.0 (2025-07-10):** \"did not support email verification by code.\" (Fix for the `verified_email_required` decorator.)\n- **65.8.0 (2025-05-08):** \"Added optional support for requesting new email/phone verification codes during signup.\" Settings: `ACCOUNT_EMAIL_VERIFICATION_SUPPORTS_RESEND` and `ACCOUNT_PHONE_VERIFICATION_SUPPORTS_RESEND`.\n- **65.6.0 (2025-03-27):** \"was not respected when using password reset by code.\" (Fix for `ACCOUNT_LOGIN_ON_PASSWORD_RESET`.)\n- **65.5.0 (2025-03-14):** \"Added support for resetting passwords by code, instead of a link.\" Setting: `ACCOUNT_PASSWORD_RESET_BY_CODE_ENABLED`.\n- **65.12.0 (2025-10-05):** \"an email address that was in the process of being verified by code\" was listed but could not be deleted. (Headless fix.)\n\n**Login by code and new-user signup:** No entry says that login by code can sign up a new user with an unknown email. The only login-by-code setting listed is `ACCOUNT_LOGIN_BY_CODE_TRUST_ENABLED`, which relates to trusting a browser, not to signup.\n\nThe visible content covers releases from 65.13.1 back to 65.4.0 only."}]},"uuid":"62362b40-c564-4a8d-a181-958144f08f96","timestamp":"2026-11-03T14:41:51.009Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":85918,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**Entries mentioning \"code\" (no entries mention passkey signup, signup by code, or unknown email):**\n\n- **65.13.0 (2025-10-31):** \"Added support for “Trust this browser?” functionality for logging in by code.\" Setting: `ACCOUNT_LOGIN_BY_CODE_TRUST_ENABLED`.\n- **65.10.0 (2025-07-10):** \"did not support email verification by code.\" (Fix for the `verified_email_required` decorator.)\n- **65.8.0 (2025-05-08):** \"Added optional support for requesting new email/phone verification codes during signup.\" Settings: `ACCOUNT_EMAIL_VERIFICATION_SUPPORTS_RESEND` and `ACCOUNT_PHONE_VERIFICATION_SUPPORTS_RESEND`.\n- **65.6.0 (2025-03-27):** \"was not respected when using password reset by code.\" (Fix for `ACCOUNT_LOGIN_ON_PASSWORD_RESET`.)\n- **65.5.0 (2025-03-14):** \"Added support for resetting passwords by code, instead of a link.\" Setting: `ACCOUNT_PASSWORD_RESET_BY_CODE_ENABLED`.\n- **65.12.0 (2025-10-05):** \"an email address that was in the process of being verified by code\" was listed but could not be deleted. (Headless fix.)\n\n**Login by code and new-user signup:** No entry says that login by code can sign up a new user with an unknown email. The only login-by-code setting listed is `ACCOUNT_LOGIN_BY_CODE_TRUST_ENABLED`, which relates to trusting a browser, not to signup.\n\nThe visible content covers releases from 65.13.1 back to 65.4.0 only.","durationMs":9588,"url":"https://docs.allauth.org/en/dev/release-notes/2025.html"},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"192558d8-c8e9-4401-b456-c06061c61e97","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/kenneth/Projects/tsd-enterprise","sessionId":"e997298c-6edf-4c7d-8994-08bc7e301a34","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"claude/first-run-flow-f7be35","slug":"distributed-snuggling-crane"}
